  },
  "selection_policy": "Top 300 casefold-distinct NFC Latin-script male first-name tokens ranked by observed athlete-profile count descending; ties by most recent birth year then lexical; reject hyphens, initials, surname particles and displayed/legal-name mismatches; no invented frequency",
